id: jf-5u9v
title: Attribute CLI integration coverage in-process
description: Introduce a serialized in-process Commander test harness and migrate the existing portable command integration suites so their real production callbacks contribute to Vitest V8 coverage while preserving Bun and packaged black-box acceptance gates.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: agents,cli,coverage,testing,vitest
created_at: "2026-08-07T17:00:33.675Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-07T17:31:32.848Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-07T17:14:50.201Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-07T17:14:50.201Z"
author: codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Existing command behavior tests execute through the production createProgram tree under Vitest without duplicated cases; Portable suite remains deterministic and materially faster; Four-axis coverage improves without exclusions ignore directives threshold weakening or coverage-only execution; Bun full tests compiled read-only E2E and release validation remain green
goal: jf-mqpo
value: Convert existing behavioral evidence into accurate source-level coverage instead of adding artificial tests.
impact: Raises trustworthy command callback coverage and shortens the portable feedback loop.
outcome: A reusable typed in-process CLI harness with measured four-axis improvement and documented remaining gaps.
why_now: Subprocess execution is the dominant attribution gap blocking the canonical 100 percent coverage item.
parent: jf-mkzh
reviewer: maintainer
risk: high
confidence: high
sprint: jellyfin-10.11.11
resolution: "Centralized migrated command execution behind a typed dual-runtime harness: serialized production Commander execution under Vitest for V8 attribution and true subprocess execution under Bun for black-box runtime isolation."
expected_result: "Existing command integration behavior contributes to authoritative V8 coverage without duplicated cases, ignored source, weakened thresholds, or loss of Bun and compiled live acceptance."
actual_result: "Portable suite passed 1008 tests with 1 skip; V8 coverage increased from 44.06/45.14/54.43/43.83 to 59.08/67.93/63.48/59.38; Bun passed 1018 tests; compiled read-only live E2E passed 185 tests; release, security, package-consumer, and PM-owned acceptance gates passed."
